          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are critically hit by an enemy.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Avatar] spell prepared.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>In moments of danger, you can call upon your god's form in an instant. You cast <em>avatar</em> from your spell slots. The triggering critical hit is reduced to a normal hit, and its damage is applied after gaining the <em>avatar</em> spell's temporary Hit Points.</p>"
